{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0663_1000_p", "source_sha256": "af59bb310ff67946fff2208735c9b610050c7d980f2cbe8efae4ba0f6d5a32d7", "ja": "（いよいよその時が迫ってきた……。勝負は一瞬。\n風花もわかっているはず。……だよな？）", "zh": "（那个时刻终于越来越近了……胜负就在一瞬间。风花应该也明白。……对吧？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0663_1001_041fuk", "source_sha256": "46eb4d2f9d9f0134718bb56c3718cc0c896d1b2163566e769b22579d029c6e1c", "ja": "…………（コクリ）。", "zh": "…………（点头）。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0663_1002_p", "source_sha256": "d5331df112fcc4dc462470908cbda4d904bb941ae0dfba3ba3e7233a6f87cd0a", "ja": "（もうすぐだ。……3、2、1！\n今だ！）", "zh": "（快了……3、2、1！就是现在！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0663_1003_p", "source_sha256": "537e94c4c99bf96160ddc28cefba52d7d703df8b90a540cdb61c897a661442f7", "ja": "（うわあああっ、ダメだ！！\nぐるぐるしたまま、ぜんぜん進まない……！！）", "zh": "（哇啊啊啊，糟了！！\n一直在转圈，完全没法继续……！！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0663_1004_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d9edbbf16e36aed181b8fddcaf357de1caae341f54a6b306e1998290f0600b25", "ja": "やったぁ！　{$P$}さん、\n決済まで行けました！", "zh": "太好了！{$P$}先生，\n已经进入结算界面了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0663_1005_p", "source_sha256": "4a6ba1178db164f01766a2b820d794bcdb0828c74f59b591742b9391045e15af", "ja": "えっ、本当に！？", "zh": "诶，真的吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0663_1006_041fuk", "source_sha256": "5948356ee6240a6cef682ab9a5a7403265143068a9b718c38e5bb1bcf13b6479", "ja": "はい、大丈夫……なはず！\nえっと、完了メールも……うん、来ました！", "zh": "嗯，没问题……应该吧！\n那个，完成邮件也……嗯，收到了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0663_1007_041fuk", "source_sha256": "55a903bcfb28850f619ffe567ff5387b924980dbe42fbf817969877c90af7dba", "ja": "これで貴音ちゃんと行けます！　『休日限定・\n月と紅葉のオータムイブニングハイティー』プラン！", "zh": "这样就能和贵音一起去了！　“仅限节假日・\n月与红叶的秋日傍晚下午茶”套餐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0663_1008_p", "source_sha256": "be4b7fd5440fe561f92b1d1d90808cb3263a068698c15db79b32477e68b91065", "ja": "よ、よかった、風花のほうがつながったか……。\nごめん、役に立てなくて。", "zh": "太、太好了，风花那边打通了啊……\n抱歉，我没能帮上忙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0663_1009_041fuk", "source_sha256": "df59b0c1e9ba8f3c4249bc8dece3952ae3dfb459f24de56c281dc87394912f16", "ja": "いいえ、{$P$}さんが手伝ってくれて\n心強かったです。ひとりだと失敗しちゃってたかも。", "zh": "没有的事，多亏有{$P$}先生帮忙，\n我心里踏实多了。要是我一个人的话，说不定就失败了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0663_1010_041fuk", "source_sha256": "3604db2c19eb58732e30ea7e7a93ac1a36b4f1e5324701389e30923893edf350", "ja": "このプラン、大人気で全然予約が取れなくて……\n先着順だから、もうドキドキしちゃって。", "zh": "这个方案太受欢迎了，完全订不到……  \n因为是先到先得，我紧张得不得了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0663_1011_p", "source_sha256": "557cef5e56a744d26733e9671cb5210127fa9d7874bd1352bce87b7b716c45c6", "ja": "ラグジュアリーなホテルラウンジの数量限定プランか。\nメニューも華やかで繊細で、サービスも細やかで……", "zh": "是豪华酒店酒廊的限量套餐啊。菜单也华丽而精致，服务也无微不至……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0663_1012_p", "source_sha256": "f2a3aa9c1d9b682d639dadec11b90618e24c24ba378fc4fb6ec2a5c3ce348106", "ja": "人気なのもわかるよ。貴音も好きそうだし。", "zh": "很受欢迎也是有道理的。贵音应该也会喜欢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0663_1013_041fuk", "source_sha256": "fe96dee6ca3bfd9f73b4f9eb2fe25a3c14e3a8e2bff81aeaae3b50e9a90683ea", "ja": "そうなんです！　この間、貴音ちゃんとご飯に行けなか\nったから、リベンジさせてもらう約束で。", "zh": "就是这样！上次没能和贵音一起去吃饭，所以约好了让我再挑战一次。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0663_1014_041fuk", "source_sha256": "428aa1c2bd94c37c59ee3b8c99594254c5e109cf33deced3608bccd8b5a41e9c", "ja": "もちろん貴音ちゃんは、「どこでもかまいません」\nなんて言ってくれてはいましたけど……", "zh": "当然，贵音也说过“哪里都可以”，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0663_1015_041fuk", "source_sha256": "26759383186ea88df05c697bde9326a913b1e1234fe7af56b6d1e49b3bb0ca0e", "ja": "候補をいくつか出した時に、このプランを見た\n貴音ちゃんの瞳が、一瞬、キラッて！", "zh": "提出几个候选方案时，看到这个计划的贵音，眼睛有一瞬间闪闪发亮！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0663_1016_p", "source_sha256": "de62356a1e614e9a8ca6b91bae009664e17c8620924b5a4bda72e9db8a5063ea", "ja": "ほほう……。", "zh": "哦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0663_1017_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ec5a82ebf0f87ee24b2e5496136b7fbd5404d038e4d4f795e06735fb5371ac89", "ja": "私は見逃しませんでしたよ♪　あれは心をギュッと\n掴まれたやつです。だからどうしても押さえようって。", "zh": "我可没有错过哦♪ 那一瞬间，心一下子被紧紧抓住了。所以无论如何都想按下去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0663_1018_041fuk", "source_sha256": "093f51425645c66daeec571674f06b1ca6fd3623293df03e5406ea391d73cac3", "ja": "はぁぁ、よかったぁ。\nこれで私も、少しはお姉さんぶれますね♪", "zh": "哈啊啊，太好了。\n这样一来，我也能稍微表现得像个姐姐了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0663_1019_p", "source_sha256": "4a827f48255e13520d81c1b5ae77f18dbf9830a1a36d9e3959d3f5d9087befd3", "ja": "……ん？　風花のほうがお姉さんなのは\n間違いないんじゃないか？", "zh": "……嗯？风花本来就比她年长，\n这点毫无疑问吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0663_1020_041fuk", "source_sha256": "4754edccf5a88feae03dd4f853e2a2daf48c7442aeaccab006cb2251564743d5", "ja": "そうなんですけど、貴音ちゃんてすごく大人っぽいから\nちゃんとお姉さんできてるか、時々心配になるんです。", "zh": "虽然是这样没错，但因为贵音看起来特别成熟，所以我有时会担心自己是不是个合格的姐姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0663_1021_041fuk", "source_sha256": "7f6dc3da30dd2a600d9419fcd520ead362b0dda0378b91366e945c03b8140bf9", "ja": "でも、今回の予約でバッチリですよねっ。うふふっ♪\nそれじゃ、ありがとうございました～♪", "zh": "不过，这次的预约肯定没问题了吧。呜呼呼♪\n那么，谢谢您啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0663_1022_p", "source_sha256": "db5df285ea27b592a7fc7f7293ec5d078c075b5b25de5a6bdb6cefbf2cc2a008", "ja": "（……そのはしゃぎようだと、逆効果になりそうだけど\n……でも、ふたりの絆は深まりそうだな！）", "zh": "（……看她们这么兴奋，感觉反而会适得其反……不过，两人的羁绊似乎会加深啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
